  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ded9268c5b3ed56fb20f854d46b9866b9149d1688d5abbcbe1dee7d97dbaab83.png] \n\n**Given: 16 * 280 * 6 * 84 * 4 = 0**\n\nAfter applying symbols.\n\n**Option (1): -, ×, +, ÷**\n\n⇒ 16 - 280 × 6 + 84 ÷ 4 = 0\n\n⇒ 16 - 280 × 6 + 21 = 0\n\n⇒ 16 - 1680 + 21 = 0\n\n⇒ 37 - 1680 = 0\n\n⇒ -1643 ≠ 0\n\n**Option (2): ×, -, ÷, +**\n\n⇒ 16 × 280 - 6 ÷ 84 + 4 = 0\n\n⇒ 16 × 280 - 1/14 + 4 = 0\n\n⇒ 4480 - 0.07 + 4 = 0\n\n⇒ 4484 - 0.07 = 0\n\n⇒ 4483.93 ≠ 0\n\n**Option (3): ÷, +, -, × **\n\n⇒ 16 ÷ 280 + 6 - 84 × 4 = 0\n\n⇒ 0.057 + 6 - 336 = 0\n\n⇒ 6.057 - 336 = 0\n\n⇒ - 329.943 ≠ 0\n\n**Option (4): -, ×, ÷, +**\n\n**⇒ 16 - 280 × 6 ÷ 84 + 4 = 0**\n\n**⇒ 16 - 280 × 1/14 + 4 = 0**\n\n**⇒ 16 - 20 + 4 = 0**\n\n**⇒ 20 - 20 = 0**\n\n**⇒ 0 = 0**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"option (4)\".**",
